      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-10-16T13:01:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>To reiterate:</p><p>Hero Targets have to deal non-hero character cards 10 damage to trigger destruction. &nbsp;The only cards fitting this description are the main villain targets and the Operative, so the Ennead would make it really tough to keep that card out, where as vs. Miss Information you'd have to flip her to get rid of it, and vs. the Dreamer it would be very easy to leave it out the rest of the game.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I wonder if there are any other non-villain, non-hero character cards coming, or if the Operative is the only one.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:58:16.269Z",
